  "figureNotes": [
    "statutory table at IRC 223(b)(3)(B); not inflation adjusted, so absent from the annual Rev. Procs. See usc-26-223 and Notice 2004-2 A-14.",
    "Rules for a taxable year beginning before 2007: the §223(b)(2) lesser-of deductible cap is in force and §223(b)(8) is not yet enacted. See _policyFlagsComment and usc-26-223.",
    "Rules for a taxable year beginning after 2006: Pub. L. 109-432 §303 removed the §223(b)(2) deductible cap and §305 added the §223(b)(8) last-month rule, both applicable to taxable years beginning after December 31, 2006. See _policyFlagsComment and usc-26-223.",
    "rp-06-53 (Rev. Proc. 2006-53 section 3.24) states the 2007 HDHP deductible and out-of-pocket figures; rp-07-36 restates the 2007 contribution limits after the Tax Relief and Health Care Act of 2006 removed the deductible cap."
  ],
